@Bettina, I couldn't set up the Monday digest. The scheduler is refusing my connection because the Gateway needs credentials, so nothing is scheduled yet. I haven't posted anything. Once the scheduler is reachable I can set it up for 08:00 Chicago time every Monday, starting Monday 19 October.

The digest would cover #coastal-team and #coastal-random, which have the same members (you, Kwame, Sofia and me). It would have two parts: last week's outcomes and decisions, and open customer items. It would leave out money terms and finance documents, such as rates, prices, discounts, contract values, invoices and payment terms. Those go only to the account owner, Anselm or June, so the digest would point to the deal desk for them instead. Seat counts, renewal dates, licensed products, ticket numbers and contacts can still go in.

If the scheduler can't be fixed soon, tell me and I'll post the digest by hand on the Mondays you need it.
